# Client testimonial screenshots are deliberately NOT tracked.
#
# This repository is public. These images contain other people's personal and
# financial data — a credit report including a public bankruptcy record, a bank
# card approval, a cashier's cheque, and private message threads with named
# individuals. Committing them would publish that data permanently into git
# history, where a later delete does not remove it.
#
# The deck instead renders a labelled frame on each testimonial slide; the
# images are dropped into those frames inside Canva, where they stay private.
# Source of truth for the files is the owner's Drive folder "Presentation TSM".
assets/testimonial-*
